# Comware V5 one-shot scheduled command.
Value Required SPECIFIED_COMMAND (.+?)
Value Required SPECIFIED_VIEW (.+?)
Value Required EXECUTED_TIME (.+?)
Value Required REMAINING_TIME ([^)]+)

Start
  ^\s*Specified\s+command:\s*${SPECIFIED_COMMAND}\s*$$
  ^\s*Specified\s+view:\s*${SPECIFIED_VIEW}\s*$$
  ^\s*Executed\s+time:\s+${EXECUTED_TIME}\s+\(in\s+${REMAINING_TIME}\)\s*$$ -> Record
  ^.*$$

